# SynapseOS AI Developer Profile
# Tools install in order listed via apt, pipx, uv, or script
#
# Each line: type  package/command  [post-install-notes]
#
# Types:
#   apt    - install via apt
#   pipx   - install via pipx
#   uv     - install via uv tool
#   script - run a custom install script
#   npm    - install via npm -g
#   binary - download a binary tarball

